  "description": "Looking for a fun to ride commuter with a wide range of use? The Grandurance FB 10 EQ has you covered. Fitted with Shimano Cues components, Schwalbe G-One Overland 365 tires for year-round use and a flat handlebar for agile, comfortable handling. The EQ in the name stands for “equipped”, this bike comes fitted with a lightweight rear carrier, fenders and a full LED lighting system with hub dynamo.\n\nThis commuter bike is fun to ride and shows its strength while off-roading just as it performs in urban surroundings. Mounting points throughout round off the package in case you want to go on a bike packing trip or need to carry additional equipment.",
